{"seq":2,"slug":"granular-synthesis","title":"颗粒合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/synthesis/granular-synthesis","wordCount":1556,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"颗粒合成\">颗粒合成</h1><p>一场暴雨的声音里没有&quot;一滴雨&quot;——有的是每秒成千上万滴雨各自啪嗒一下，叠成连绵的沙沙。颗粒合成（granular synthesis）正是抓住了这个本质：它不试图建模整体，而是把声音拆成几毫秒长的&quot;声音颗粒&quot;，再以可控的密度、音高、位置把海量颗粒重新撒回时间轴，让宏观纹理从微观事件的统计叠加里涌现。这与<a href=\"physical-modeling\">物理建模合成</a>的思路截然相反——后者求解单个物体的精确物理，前者操控群体的统计分布——也因此它们在游戏里分管完全不同的声音类别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>颗粒合成</strong>不建模整体，而是把声音拆成几毫秒长的&quot;声音颗粒&quot;，再以可控的密度、音高、位置把海量颗粒重新撒回时间轴，让宏观纹理从微观事件的统计叠加里涌现。它的核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>颗粒</strong>：一段极短（1–100 毫秒）的波形乘上平滑窗函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t)=w(t)\\cdot s(t+\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，用于避免拼接爆音。</li>\n<li><strong>四个旋钮</strong>：颗粒密度、颗粒时长、取材位置、音高随机度，覆盖从稀疏滴答到密实轰鸣的全部纹理。</li>\n<li><strong>音高与时间解耦</strong>：颗粒合成能拉长声音而不变调，这是采样回放做不到的杀手锏。</li>\n<li><strong>颗粒云</strong>：实战中颗粒由调度器按统计规律持续喷洒，游戏状态驱动宏观参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"颗粒-声音的微观积木\">颗粒：声音的微观积木</h2><p>一个颗粒（grain）是一段极短（典型 1–100 毫秒）的波形，乘上一个平滑的包络窗以避免拼接处的爆音。颗粒的来源有两类：从一段录音里切（granular，最常见）、或由合成器即时生成（合成颗粒）。单个颗粒可写成源波形与窗函数的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t) = w(t) \\cdot s(t + \\tau), \\quad t \\in [0, T_g]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是源波形，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是从源里取材的位置偏移，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是窗函数（常用 Hann 窗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t)=\\tfrac{1}{2}(1-\\cos\\tfrac{2\\pi t}{T_g})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3874em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是颗粒时长。整段输出则是大量颗粒在时间轴上的叠加，每个颗粒有独立的起始时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、音高缩放与取材位置。控制这些参数的统计分布，就是颗粒合成的全部艺术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四个控制旋钮决定一切纹理\">四个控制旋钮决定一切纹理</h2><p>颗粒合成的表现力集中在四个宏观参数上，它们共同塑造从&quot;稀疏滴答&quot;到&quot;密实轰鸣&quot;的连续纹理。下表给出这四个旋钮及其听感效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制参数</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n<th>调高的听感</th>\n<th>游戏用途举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>颗粒密度</td>\n<td>每秒撒下的颗粒数</td>\n<td>从离散点变连续墙</td>\n<td>雨从小到大、人群从稀到密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颗粒时长</td>\n<td>每个颗粒多长</td>\n<td>短→颗粒感强，长→平滑</td>\n<td>沙砾 vs 流水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取材位置</td>\n<td>从源波形哪取材</td>\n<td>扫过源=时间拉伸</td>\n<td>慢动作音效、引擎升降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音高随机度</td>\n<td>各颗粒音高抖动</td>\n<td>抖动大=更自然喧闹</td>\n<td>群鸟、燃烧噼啪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最关键的洞察是音高与时间的解耦。在采样回放里，慢放一段声音会同时降低音高（磁带效应）；颗粒合成因为通过&quot;重复取同一段源材&quot;来拉长时间、通过&quot;重采样单个颗粒&quot;来调音高，二者完全独立。这让你能把一句脚步&quot;拉成&quot;两倍长却不变调——这是采样回放永远做不到的，也是颗粒合成在时间操控类音效里不可替代的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"颗粒云-从单颗粒到宏观纹理\">颗粒云：从单颗粒到宏观纹理</h2><p>实战中颗粒不是一个个手放的，而是由一个&quot;颗粒云&quot;调度器按统计规律持续喷洒。调度器读入宏观参数（密度、随机度），决定何时、以何参数生成下一个颗粒。下面的图刻画从游戏状态到最终纹理的颗粒云数据流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  STATE[游戏状态&lt;br/&gt;雨强/人群规模] --&gt; PARAM[宏观参数映射&lt;br/&gt;密度/音高抖动/时长]&#10;  SRC[源材料&lt;br/&gt;录音或合成颗粒] --&gt; CLOUD[颗粒云调度器]&#10;  PARAM --&gt; CLOUD&#10;  CLOUD --&gt; G1[颗粒 i&lt;br/&gt;取材τ_i 增益 a_i]&#10;  CLOUD --&gt; G2[颗粒 i+1&lt;br/&gt;独立随机参数]&#10;  CLOUD --&gt; GN[颗粒 ...&lt;br/&gt;每秒成百上千]&#10;  G1 --&gt; SUM[叠加 + 窗包络]&#10;  G2 --&gt; SUM&#10;  GN --&gt; SUM&#10;  SUM --&gt; TEX[涌现的宏观纹理]\">flowchart TD\n  STATE[游戏状态&lt;br/&gt;雨强/人群规模] --&gt; PARAM[宏观参数映射&lt;br/&gt;密度/音高抖动/时长]\n  SRC[源材料&lt;br/&gt;录音或合成颗粒] --&gt; CLOUD[颗粒云调度器]\n  PARAM --&gt; CLOUD\n  CLOUD --&gt; G1[颗粒 i&lt;br/&gt;取材τ_i 增益 a_i]\n  CLOUD --&gt; G2[颗粒 i+1&lt;br/&gt;独立随机参数]\n  CLOUD --&gt; GN[颗粒 ...&lt;br/&gt;每秒成百上千]\n  G1 --&gt; SUM[叠加 + 窗包络]\n  G2 --&gt; SUM\n  GN --&gt; SUM\n  SUM --&gt; TEX[涌现的宏观纹理]</pre><p>把宏观参数挂到游戏状态上，纹理就活了——雨强参数随天气系统连续变化，人群密度随附近 NPC 数实时调整。这条&quot;游戏状态→统计参数→声音&quot;的链路，到了系统章会被抽象成<a href=\"../systems/parametric-sound\">参数化音效</a>的通用模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本-伪影与适用边界\">成本、伪影与适用边界</h2><p>颗粒合成的甜区是&quot;由海量微小事件叠加而成&quot;的声音：雨、风、火、流水、人群、引擎轰鸣、群体脚步。它不适合有清晰音高与结构的声音（旋律、语音、单次清脆撞击）——那些该交给<a href=\"physical-modeling\">物理建模合成</a>或<a href=\"subtractive-additive\">减法与加法合成</a>。</p>\n<p>成本上，颗粒合成的 CPU 随颗粒密度线性增长，高密度纹理可能每秒调度上千颗粒，是合成法里偏贵的一类。常见优化有三：限制最大同时颗粒数（密度封顶），对远处/不重要的纹理降低密度做 LOD，以及复用预生成的颗粒缓冲避免重复切材。伪影方面，窗函数选不好会在颗粒边界引入周期性&quot;嗡嗡&quot;（与密度同频的调制音），需用随机化起始时刻打散。这些预算与质量的权衡属于<a href=\"../practice/procedural-audio-performance\">性能与预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>颗粒合成把声音拆成几毫秒的<strong>颗粒</strong>（源波形 × 窗函数），再以统计分布重组成宏观纹理。</li>\n<li>四个旋钮——密度、时长、取材位置、音高随机度——覆盖从稀疏滴答到密实轰鸣的全部纹理。</li>\n<li>杀手锏是<strong>音高与时间解耦</strong>：能拉长声音而不变调，采样回放做不到。</li>\n<li>最适合雨/风/火/人群/引擎这类&quot;海量微事件叠加&quot;的声音；不适合有清晰音高与结构的声音。</li>\n<li>CPU 随颗粒密度线性增长，靠密度封顶、LOD、颗粒缓冲复用来控；窗函数选不好会有周期性伪影。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>截然相反的思路（精确物理）：<a href=\"physical-modeling\">物理建模合成</a></li>\n<li>适合清晰音高的合成：<a href=\"subtractive-additive\">减法与加法合成</a></li>\n<li>统计参数如何成为系统：<a href=\"../systems/parametric-sound\">参数化音效</a></li>\n<li>密度 LOD 的预算：<a href=\"../practice/procedural-audio-performance\">性能与预算</a></li>\n<li>同类&quot;群体统计涌现&quot;的视觉版：<code>11_procedural-content-generation</code> 的<a href=\"../../procedural-content-generation/foundations/randomness-noise\">随机与噪声</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"颗粒合成","id":"颗粒合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"颗粒：声音的微观积木","id":"颗粒-声音的微观积木"},{"level":2,"text":"四个控制旋钮决定一切纹理","id":"四个控制旋钮决定一切纹理"},{"level":2,"text":"颗粒云：从单颗粒到宏观纹理","id":"颗粒云-从单颗粒到宏观纹理"},{"level":2,"text":"成本、伪影与适用边界","id":"成本-伪影与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"物理建模合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/synthesis/physical-modeling"},"next":{"title":"减法与加法合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/synthesis/subtractive-additive"}}